  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guatemala, Nicaragua. The project is called: Reconstruction of the social structures of vulnerable indigenous groups in Guatemala and Nicaragua, affected by COVID-19, to improve their quality of life&#x201D;. The project aims to develop emotional tools, social skills and the strengthening of capacities to improve the quality of life of people affected by the COVID-19 through the generation of self sustaining enterprises in accordance with the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals # 2, 3, 5, 8 and 10. A big focus of FUNDATED and CEDEHCA is still oriented to providing psychosocial support to women and young people who find themselves in situations of violence, nonethless, the project is opening up to providing beneficiaries with means and skills to lift themselves up.</narrative>
  </description>
